ISO 3166-2 subdivision data is merged from:

1. Debian iso-codes (codes, English names, types, parents)
   https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes
   License: LGPL-2.1-or-later

2. oodavid/iso-3166-2 (centroids lat/lng, additional names)
   https://github.com/oodavid/iso-3166-2

The merged dataset is data/regions.json.
